--TEST--
a cursor on the `extend` keyword names no symbol, so prepareRename is refused
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace Shop;

use Core\Time\Date;

ext<|>end Date as BusinessDays {
    public function isBusinessDay(): bool {
        return $this->day() != 19;
    }
}
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
